flowchart TD
 A[Agent proposes action] --> B[Server risk policy]
 B -->|Low risk| G[Protected tool adapter]
 B -->|High risk| C[Persist exact action and hash]
 C --> D[Notify reviewer queue]
 D --> E[Authenticate reviewer and load RBAC]
 E --> F{Role, separation, expiry and hash valid?}
 F -->|No| X[Reject and audit]
 F -->|Yes| H[Append decision]
 H --> I{Quorum reached?}
 I -->|No| D
 I -->|Yes| J[Recheck workflow version]
 J --> G
 G --> K[Idempotent side effect and audit]
